2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"14qJA3j7Ut5_mQ691BT8aA","review_id":"0nW8Inv-wGKdO5cPd6dfxQ","date":"2013-12-28T16:23:03","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9546172618865967,"text_excerpt":"I love this little place! It rocks. We were so enthralled by the appetizer menu, we decided to stick with that. Plus a burger. The fried mushrooms came out like fried pickles - a bunch of slices with a delicious sauce. I loved them. Didn't try the mussels, but they looked good. The Brie fries - YUM. it's more like a roux sauce, not just melted cheese, which I think makes it a much better dish. The bacon fritters were okay - they were actually really dry. Wish we would have tried the pork belly - but we'll be back. The baie burger was DELICIOUS and giant. It was really one of the best burgers I've had at a non-burger joint. The service was great and sweet, and I can't wait to go back."},{"business_id":"14qJA3j7Ut5_mQ691BT8aA","review_id":"6dlIqafJ0_YTYYt0ndEmlQ","date":"2014-06-30T16:11:13","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9491862058639526,"text_excerpt":"I have been dying to try this place out, after seeing photos of the brie fries on Yelp! And boy, they did not disappoint. I am super picky about French fries, and theirs were excellent...thin cut and fried to perfection...not greasy or cardboard tasting. The brie made the perfect topping. It was everything I thought it would be. We also tried the bacon beignets...these were really different and good, I was very happy! This would be a perfect complement to eggs, for brunch! We also got the special of the day, ham and cheese croissant sandwich with coleslaw. The sandwich was yummy, it had a smear of horseradish mustard or something. I wouldn't go back for this, but it was basic fuel. The co..."},{"business_id":"14qJA3j7Ut5_mQ691BT8aA","review_id":"84-G_wY4PJdivGFMXX4Xjw","date":"2013-08-12T15:05:03","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9389647245407104,"text_excerpt":"This place is excellent for brunch. The service is very friendly, the setting is bright and cheery, and the food was outstanding. They take brunch favorites and add their own little twists, which really give the food a unique spin. For example, the chicken and waffles doesn't use a breaded breast or tender but a leg. I wouldn't think that dark meat would work in this dish, but it was surprisingly tasty. Also, instead of a traditional hollandaise sauce on the eggs benedict, they topped the eggs with a savory brie cheese sauce, making it probably the best eggs benedict I have ever had. There was not much of a crowd either, so you don't have to worry about sitting outside in the heat waiting..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"14qJA3j7Ut5_mQ691BT8aA","photo_id":"09V6I9jXdCZlON0bE79v8Q","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/09V6I9jXdCZlON0bE79v8Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9396865367889404},{"business_id":"14qJA3j7Ut5_mQ691BT8aA","photo_id":"yz7UppIKHgviDYRjTDLRHg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/yz7UppIKHgviDYRjTDLRHg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8453034162521362},{"business_id":"14qJA3j7Ut5_mQ691BT8aA","photo_id":"L2UI1sOL4RcnjNXtVOwPHg","label":"food","image_ur